@Server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5057

### Health Check
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Cập nhật hồ sơ cá nhân (Yêu cầu Bearer Token)
PUT {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN_O_DAY>

{
  "fullName": "Nguyễn Quang Hưng (Updated)",
  "phoneNumber": "0987654321",
  "currentPassword": "",
  "newPassword": ""
}

### Đổi mật khẩu cá nhân
PUT {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN_O_DAY>

{
  "fullName": "Nguyễn Quang Hưng",
  "phoneNumber": "0987654321",
  "currentPassword": "Anhhung1@",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword123@"
}
